OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day.
OL,6,FA few light, showery outbreaks of rain
OL,7,For drizzle can't be ruled out in the
OL,8,Fmorning, before an increasing risk of
OL,9,Fsome heavier showers in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with scattered showers
OL,12,Fduring the evening. The showers will
OL,13,Fease and clear through the night, but
OL,14,Fmist and fog patches spreading in
OL,15,Fovernight will bring some patchy
OL,16,Fdrizzle.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
