OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FThe odd light shower at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise a mainly dry but cloudy
OL,7,Fmorning. Rain will spread across from
OL,8,Fthe west through the afternoon,
OL,9,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavier later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,13,Fchangeable period with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain. Staying quite
OL,15,Fcool for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
